```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User/Agent
    participant CM as CompositeMemory
    participant EB as EbbinghausMemoryStore
    participant SG as SemanticGraphStore
    participant RG as RAG DocumentStore
    participant CD as ContradictionDetector
    participant LLM as Hermes Agent (LLM Judge)
    
    Note over U,LLM: Cross-source Contradiction Detection Flow
    
    U->>CM: search_documents("キャッシュフロー分析")
    CM->>RG: search_documents()
    RG-->>CM: RAG chunks (投資CF最重要)
    
    U->>CM: recall("キャッシュフロー分析")
    CM->>EB: recall()
    EB-->>CM: Ebbinghaus memories (営業CF最重要)
    
    U->>CM: search_nodes("キャッシュフロー分析")
    CM->>SG: search_nodes()
    SG-->>CM: CoG nodes (FCF最重要)
    
    U->>CD: detect_contradictions("キャッシュフロー分析")
    CD->>EB: recall(query, limit=5)
    CD->>RG: search_documents(query, top_k=5)
    CD->>SG: search_nodes(query, top_k=5)
    
    CD->>CD: Build Judge Prompt
    Note right of CD: 3ソースのクレームを統合\n矛盾タイプ5種定義\nJSON出力指定
    
    CD->>LLM: Judge Prompt
    LLM-->>CD: JSON判定結果
    Note right of LLM: has_contradiction: true\ncontradiction_type: factual\nconfidence: 0.85
    
    CD-->>U: ContradictionResult
